; claude: diagrams as Visio made them (TinyVisio, apps/graphics/): a
; page of shapes whose geometry is formulas in named cells, the whole
; page one sheet of appkits/sheet's engine, so that glue is a formula
; and a connector follows the shape it is glued to (Diagram); and the
; connectors' right-angled routes around the shapes (Ortho_route).
;
; Pure OCaml, no gui, no playground: a private library, installed as
; part of elm_playground; tested without a screen in appkits/tests/.
(library
 (name appkit_diagram)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries appkit_sheet)
)
